      "type": "tutorial",
      "heading": "Penyaringan Daftar Konfigurasi",
      "id": "advanced-search",
      "intro": "Modul ini memungkinkan pengguna menyaring daftar konfigurasi ISO8583 berdasarkan kriteria tertentu. Panel pencarian berukuran 320px muncul di sisi kanan area konten.",
      "steps": [
        {
          "num": 1,
          "title": "Membuka Panel Pencarian",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Klik ikon **Search** pada toolbar untuk membuka panel filter.\n• Panel pencarian berukuran **320px** muncul di sisi kanan area konten.\n• Gunakan tombol **X** di pojok kanan atas panel untuk menutup.",
          "color": "#6366f1",
          "bg": "#eef2ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 4px 20px rgba(99,102,241,.1);border:1px solid #c7d2fe;background:#fff;width:260px;margin:0 auto;\"><div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;\"><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><div><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:800;color:#1e1b4b;\">Search Config</span><span style=\"margin-left:6px;padding:2px 6px;border-radius:8px;background:#eef2ff;border:1px solid #c7d2fe;font-size:7.5px;font-weight:700;color:#6366f1;\">Filter</span></div><div style=\"width:16px;height:16px;border-radius:4px;background:#f1f5f9;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:9px;color:#94a3b8;font-weight:700;\">✕</div></div><div style=\"font-size:8.5px;color:#64748b;margin-top:3px;\">Set filters and apply</div></div><div style=\"padding:10px 14px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px;\"><span style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#374151;\">Name</span><div style=\"padding:5px 8px;border:1.5px solid #cbd5e1;border-radius:5px;color:#94a3b8;font-size:9px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;\"><svg width=\"10\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"2\"><circle cx=\"11\" cy=\"11\" r=\"8\"/><path d=\"m21 21-4.35-4.35\"/></svg>e.g. Config Name</div></div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px;\"><span style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#374151;\">Bitmap Encoding</span><div style=\"padding:5px 8px;border:1.5px solid #cbd5e1;border-radius:5px;color:#94a3b8;font-size:9px;\">Choose bitmap encoding</div></div></div><div style=\"padding:8px 14px;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;display:flex;gap:6px;\"><button style=\"flex:1;padding:5px;border-radius:5px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;color:#475569;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;\">Reset</button><button style=\"flex:1;padding:5px;border-radius:5px;background:#6366f1;border:none;color:#fff;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;\">Apply Filters</button></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 2,
          "title": "Filter yang Tersedia",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\nPanel pencarian menyediakan filter berikut:\n\n1. **Name**: Cari berdasarkan nama konfigurasi. Mendukung pencarian parsial (partial match).\n2. **Bitmap Encoding**: Filter berdasarkan tipe encoding bitmap — pilih dari `ASCII`, `BINARY`, atau `EBCDIC`.\n\n• Klik **Apply Filters** untuk menerapkan filter.\n• Klik **Reset** untuk menghapus semua filter dan menampilkan seluruh data.\n• Setelah filter diterapkan, halaman akan kembali ke halaman pertama.",
          "color": "#4f46e5",
          "bg": "#eef2ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 4px 20px rgba(99,102,241,.08);border:1px solid #c7d2fe;background:#fff;width:280px;margin:0 auto;\"><div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;background:#eef2ff;\"><div style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:800;color:#1e1b4b;\">Available Filters</div><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#6366f1;margin-top:1px;\">Filter by name and encoding type</div></div><div style=\"padding:10px 14px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;\"><div style=\"padding:8px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:rgba(99,102,241,.04);border:1px solid #c7d2fe;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;margin-bottom:4px;\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"2\"><circle cx=\"11\" cy=\"11\" r=\"8\"/><path d=\"m21 21-4.35-4.35\"/></svg><span style=\"font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#1e1b4b;\">Name Filter</span></div><div style=\"font-size:7.5px;color:#64748b;\">Partial match search</div></div><div style=\"padding:8px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:rgba(99,102,241,.04);border:1px solid #c7d2fe;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;margin-bottom:4px;\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M21 16V8a2 2 0 00-1-1.73l-7-4a2 2 0 00-2 0l-7 4A2 2 0 003 8v8a2 2 0 001 1.73l7 4a2 2 0 002 0l7-4A2 2 0 0021 16z\"/></svg><span style=\"font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#1e1b4b;\">Bitmap Encoding</span></div><div style=\"font-size:7.5px;color:#64748b;\">ASCII, BINARY, EBCDIC</div></div></div><div style=\"padding:8px 14px;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;display:flex;gap:6px;\"><div style=\"flex:1;text-align:center;\"><div style=\"font-size:7.5px;font-weight:700;color:#64748b;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.5px;\">Actions</div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:4px;margin-top:4px;\"><span style=\"flex:1;padding:3px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;font-size:7.5px;font-weight:700;color:#475569;text-align:center;\">Reset</span><span style=\"flex:1;padding:3px;border-radius:4px;background:#6366f1;font-size:7.5px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;text-align:center;\">Apply</span></div></div></div></div>"
